        "question": "Can I use NodeTool and ComfyUI together?",
        "answer": "Yes, and plenty of people do. A common split is to keep a tuned ComfyUI pipeline for a specific diffusion look and use NodeTool for everything around it — the video, the voice, the batch, the delivery. They are both open source and neither takes your files hostage."
